cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you reference this project in a paper, report, or course work, please cite it as below."
title: "Yancec: an auditable market-research agent"
abstract: >-
  An evidence-driven market research agent built on a 16-node LangGraph state machine.
  Claims carry sources, levels and confidence; a deterministic rule layer detects numeric
  conflicts; and every run ships an eight-file audit bundle whose verification scripts
  recompute the report using the Python standard library alone.
authors:
